<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS cuts Swissair to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>UBS cuts Swissair to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it had cut its earnings forecasts for Swisssair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG and reduced its recommendation for shares to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>Swissair shares were down nine Swiss francs to 1,010 in a generally steady to firmer market.</p>
</text>
